    {
      "group": "lower-alpha",
      "lang": "en",
      "number": 10,
      "text": "This figure, like most official data for the United States as a whole, excludes the five unincorporated territories (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puerto_Rico\">Puerto Rico</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guam\">Guam</a>, the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U.S._Virgin_Islands\">U.S. Virgin Islands</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_Samoa\">American Samoa</a>, and the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northern_Mariana_Islands\">Northern Mariana Islands</a>) and minor island possessions."
    },
