    },
    {
      "id": "names",
      "prose_links": [
        {
          "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States#Etymology",
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Etymology"
        }
      ],
      "prose_text": {
        "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States#Etymology",
        "html": "Documented use of the phrase &quot;United States of America&quot; dates back to January 2, 1776. On that day, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stephen_Moylan\">Stephen Moylan</a>, a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Continental_Army\">Continental Army</a> aide to General <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_Washington\">George Washington</a>, wrote a letter to <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_Reed_(politician)\">Joseph Reed</a>, Washington's <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aide-de-camp\">aide-de-camp</a>, seeking to go &quot;with full and ample powers from the United States of America to Spain&quot; to seek assistance in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_Revolutionary_War\">Revolutionary War</a> effort.<sup data-note=\"4\"></sup><sup data-note=\"5\"></sup> The first known public usage is an <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anonymous_work\">anonymous essay</a> published in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Williamsburg,_Virginia\">Williamsburg</a> newspaper <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Virginia_Gazette\">The Virginia Gazette</a></i> on April 6, 1776.<sup data-note=\"4\"></sup> Sometime on or after June 11, 1776, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Jefferson\">Thomas Jefferson</a> wrote &quot;United States of America&quot; in a rough draft of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Declaration_of_Independence\">Declaration of Independence</a>,<sup data-note=\"4\"></sup> which was adopted by the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_Continental_Congress\">Second Continental Congress</a> on July 4, 1776.<sup data-note=\"6\"></sup>",
        "lang": "en",
        "local": true,
        "title": "Etymology"
      },
      "title": {
        "href": "https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q82799",
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbols",
      "prose_links": [],
